  "openstax_section": "OpenStax AF2e §3.4",
  "guide_line": "Write an electron configuration.",
  "steps": [
    "Fill in order: 1s 2s 2p 3s 3p 4s 3d 4p.",
    "Superscripts must add up to the number of electrons.",
    "Cr is 4s1 3d5. Cu is 4s1 3d10.",
    "A noble-gas core is fine: [Ne] means 1s2 2s2 2p6.",
    "For a cation, remove electrons from the highest n first. 4s leaves before 3d."
  ],
